                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in">
                                        <h2 style="font-weight: normal;">Our impact</h2>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
                                        <p>01.</p>
                                        <h3 class="h5-fs">Preservation</h3>
                                        <p>Your donation helps maintain the historic architecture and grounds of the clubhouse, preserving its character for generations of members to come.</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
                                        <p>02.</p>
                                        <h3 class="h5-fs">Community</h3>
                                        <p>Every contribution supports the gatherings, dinners, and events that bring members together, keeping the club's spirit of connection alive.</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 offset-lg-4 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
                                        <div class="s_hr pt32 pb32" data-snippet="s_hr" data-name="Separator">
                                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto"/>
                                        </div>
                                        <p>03.</p>
                                        <h3 class="h5-fs">Access</h3>
                                        <p>Donations fund scholarships and reduced-fee memberships, opening the doors of the club to promising individuals who might not otherwise have access.</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 o_colored_level o_animate o_anim_fade_in" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
