                                            <hr class="w-100 mx-auto"/>
                                        </div>
                                        <p>04.</p>
                                        <h3 class="h5-fs">Legacy</h3>
                                        <p>Your support today shapes the club's next chapter, funding renovations and new spaces that future members will enjoy for decades.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
